        "Seamlessly blend the face, neck, and hairline while strictly preserving the exact facial identity, bone structure, and fine facial features. Transform the hair into natural straight hair with organic imperfections, realistic texture, and fine flyaway strands along the hairline and temples that naturally frame the face. Harmonize the skin tone, undertones, exposure, and color temperature between the face, neck, chest, and body. Eliminate all harsh boundary seams, mask lines, and color shifts around the jawline and collarbone, ensuring a soft, photorealistic gradient transition. Render realistic skin texture with visible micro-pores, natural subsurface scattering, and matching ambient lighting, completely free of any smooth, artificial, or plastic look. Keep all background elements, clothing, and surrounding details untouched."
