      "title": "Pixaroma Auto-Scale (<1024p) & Stitch",
      "widgets_values": [
        "### Proportional Auto-Scale & Non-Destructive Stitch\n1. **Clean Input**: `LoadImage` connects DIRECTLY to `PixaromaInpaintCrop`. Mask editor loads instantly.\n2. **Auto-Upscale Crop (<1024p)**: If the masked area is small (e.g. 250px), `PixaromaInpaintCrop` automatically upscales the crop by factor S (e.g. 4.0x) so its long side hits 1024px for Qwen.\n3. **Proportional Base Match**: `PixaromaInpaintStitch` (with `output_resolution = 'upscale_to_crop'`) automatically upscales the ENTIRE base image by the exact same factor S via Lanczos, and stitches the 1024p Qwen generation 1:1.\n4. No details are lost to downscaling; the full image and the inpaint remain ultra-crisp."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {}
    }
